LAD'22 - Lustre Administrators and Developers Workshop

September 26-28, 2022
Hybrid event, Paris, France

The Lustre Administrator & Developer workshop is a great opportunity for wo=
rldwide Lustre administrators and developers to gather and exchange their e=
xperiences, developments, tools, best practices and more.

After 2 years of virtual LADs, we are happy to announce that we will be abl=
e to welcome you again this year for this LAD'22 edition!
This will be an hybrid event in Paris on the 26th and 27th of September 202=
2, followed by the Lustre's developer summit on September 28th.

In order to limit the financial risk due to uncertainties of the number of =
participants who will actually travel, the number of face-to-face participa=
nts will be limited to 40.
For those who can't attend in person, the presentations will be streamed li=
ve, and a chat will allow asking questions to the speakers.

Save the date, and keep updated of the upcoming call for presentations and =
the opening of registrations!

Best regards,
The LAD organization team

Web site:
https://www.eofs.eu/events/lad22


